@startuml seq_cancel_booking
title Increment 6 - Cancel Booking (FR-RS-06)
autonumber
hide footbox

actor Guest
actor Receptionist
boundary "Guest / Staff UI" as UI
control "Booking Management API" as API
control "Access Control" as Auth
control "Billing / Simulated Payment" as Billing
database "Hotel Database" as DB

== Request and authorization ==
alt Guest cancellation
  Guest -> UI : Request booking cancellation
  UI -> API : Cancel (reference, code, requestId)
  API -> Auth : Rate-limit; verify reference + code
  Auth -> DB : Retrieve code hash for reference
  DB --> Auth : Record/hash or no match
  Auth -> Auth : Verify code and booking scope
else Receptionist cancellation
  Receptionist -> UI : Request cancellation using staff account
  UI -> API : Cancel (reservationId, staffSession, requestId)
  API -> Auth : Check staff session and Receptionist role
end
Auth --> API : Authorized / denied

alt Unauthorized
  API --> UI : Deny without booking details
else Authorized
  API -> DB : BEGIN; lock reservation and check requestId
  DB --> API : Status, check-in time and prior result (if any)
  alt Request already processed
    API -> DB : End transaction without a second refund
    API --> UI : Return previously recorded cancellation outcome
  else New request
    API -> API : Check Confirmed status, no check-in, and\nserver time < 14:00 on scheduled check-in date
    alt Not Confirmed or at/after check-in cutoff
      API -> DB : ROLLBACK
      API --> UI : Deny; inventory and payment unchanged
    else Eligible cancellation
      API -> DB : Mark Cancelled, release booked nights,\nrecord refund eligibility/requestId and audit; COMMIT
      DB --> API : Cancellation saved
      alt At least 24h before scheduled check-in
        API -> Billing : Process full eligible simulated refund (requestId)
        Billing --> API : Refunded / needs reconciliation
      else Less than 24h but before check-in
        API -> Billing : Record no-refund decision
        Billing --> API : No refund
      end
      API --> UI : Return cancellation and refund status
    end
  end
end

note over API,DB
  Cancelled status stays committed even if a refund needs reconciliation.
  Do not refund twice for duplicate requests.
  A Pending hold can be cancelled in Increment 5's payment flow.
end note
@enduml
